.Dd August 22, 2026
.Dt PQLEDGER 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm pqledger
.Nd filesystem Integrity Evidence ledger
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Cm onestage | onestart | onerotate | oneverify | oneuninstall | testdrift
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
maintains an append-only hash-chained log on a ZFS dataset labeled
.Ql lomac/high .
The in-band source is
.Xr audit 4
plus policy morphisms
.Pq establish, repair, label, enforce .
.Pa /var/audit
is not tamper-evident.
.Pp
.Cm rotate
appends a checkpoint record.
Rewrite is a bug.
.Cm verify
walks
.Em prevHash
and the content hash.
Production hash is SHA-512.
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Pa /usr/local/etc/pqfreebsd/ledger.conf
.It Pa /var/db/pqledger/chain
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr pqfreebsd 7 ,
.Xr audit 4 ,
.Xr auditd 8 ,
.Xr praudit 1 ,
.Xr zfs 8
